    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Shows affiliate marketing blocks in Gutenberg editor in different styles. It comes with a lot of customization options. You can easily customize the blocks as per your need.</p>\n<h3>Key Features of Afftra</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple, Lightweight, fast. </li>\n<li>highly customizable</li>\n<li>Clean &amp; Smart Customization Panels</li>\n<li>100% responsive</li>\n<li>Easy to use</li>\n<li>Unlimited design possibilities</li>\n<li>No coding required</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/affiliate-marketing-blocks</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility check</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
